                          "text":  "On the last day, Dave parked me a short way from the lander so my camera could watch them leave. First he stood in front of the camera and dropped a hammer and a feather at the same moment. With no air to slow the feather, they hit the ground together, just as Galileo said they would.\n\nThen the engine fired and they were gone. I am still parked here, facing the spot where they left.",
